OL,3,GNEWSAWho gets food waste collections in
OL,4,Athe North East?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore councils have started making
OL,7,Fweekly food waste collections after
OL,8,Fmissing a government deadline to do so
OL,9,Fbut many are still not providing a full
OL,10,Fservice.
OL,12,FLocal authorities were given until
OL,13,FMarch this year to introduce weekly
OL,14,Ffood waste collections.
OL,16,FIn June, just four out of the 12
OL,17,Fcouncils in north-east England had
OL,18,Fbegun providing the scheme to all
OL,19,Fresidents. Since then, Middlesbrough
OL,20,FCouncil has started a full service.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
